  "name": "Lunar Strike",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/svg/daze.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A streak of lunar energy flares through the air. Choose one creature within range, or choose two creatures within range that are within 5 feet of each other. A target must succeed on a Dexterity save or take 1d6 force damage.</p><p>If cast while outdoors with a clear view of the moon, the spell instead deals 1d8 force damage.</p><p><strong><em>At Higher Levels.</em></strong> The spell's damage increases by one die when you reach 5th level (2d6 or 2d8), 11th level (3d6 or 3d8), and 17th level (4d6 or 4d8).</p>",
